      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文**\n\n全新安裝沒有模型檔，這支「Qwen 文生圖」範本需要以下 4 個檔案：\n\n- `qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/` → 7.26 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors\n- `qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/` → 9.35 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n- `qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/vae/` → 0.68 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors\n- `qwen3-vl-4b-heretic.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/` → 8.27 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/DreamFast/Qwen3-VL-4b-Heretic-ComfyUI/resolve/main/qwen3-vl-4b-heretic.safetensors\n  （這是「想法 → 英文提示詞」小幫手用的 Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct Heretic 無審查版；平台目前沒有這幾顆的備份鏡像，請走官方載點。）\n\n共約 25.6 GB；其中 `qwen3-vl-4b-heretic` 和其他範本共用，裝過就不用再抓。\n另外 worker 的 ComfyUI 要 **0.37 以上**才有 `TextEncodeQwenImage21` 節點。\n放好檔案後**不用重啟 ComfyUI 或 worker**：ComfyFed agent 每 10 分鐘自動重掃模型庫存並回報平台，評估會自動轉綠；急著馬上生效的話，手動重啟 agent 即可。\n\n---\n\n**English**\n\nA fresh install has none of these files. The Qwen text-to-image template needs 4 files:\n\n- `qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/` -> 7.26 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors\n- `qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/` -> 9.35 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n- `qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/vae/` -> 0.68 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors\n- `qwen3-vl-4b-heretic.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/` -> 8.27 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/DreamFast/Qwen3-VL-4b-Heretic-ComfyUI/resolve/main/qwen3-vl-4b-heretic.safetensors\n  (The uncensored prompt-helper encoder, shared with the other idea-box templates. No ComfyFed mirror for these yet, so use the official links.)\n\nAbout 25.6 GB in total. The worker's ComfyUI must be **0.37+** for the `TextEncodeQwenImage21` node. After placing the files there is **no need to restart ComfyUI or the worker** — the agent rescans its model inventory every 10 minutes; restart the agent manually if you need it picked up right away."
      ],
      "title": "⓪ 缺模型？/ Missing models?"
    },
