      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 文生圖（Qwen-Image-2.1）＋ 中文想法直接生\n\n打一段**中文**（或英文）想法就生一張圖，**什麼題材都可以**。\n這支和「文生圖（Chroma1-HD）」**預設同一句武俠想法**，方便直接比較兩個模型的畫風與品質。\n紅框那顆「想法」節點是你唯一要改的地方：AI（Qwen3-VL-4B Heretic，無審查版）會先把你的想法整理成結構完整的英文提示詞，再自動接進 `TextEncodeQwenImage21`，最後由 **Qwen-Image-2.1**（阿里 2026-09 開源的 7B 模型，中文語境與圖內文字表現特別好）畫出來。\n尺寸 1024×1024、步數 25、CFG 1（官方建議值）。\n\n**怎麼用：**\n1. 改紅框「想法」節點的文字（中文即可，一句話寫清楚主體、動作、場景、氛圍）。\n2. 按右上角 Run，等 worker 跑完，圖片出現在最右邊的 `SaveImage`；AI 寫出的英文提示詞會顯示在旁邊的預覽節點。\n3. 想自己直接寫英文提示詞：把 `TextEncodeQwenImage21` 的 `prompt` 輸入線拔掉，欄位就會變回可以手打。\n\n⚠ 這支範本需要 worker 的 ComfyUI **0.37 以上**（`TextEncodeQwenImage21` 節點）；太舊會直接報「找不到節點」。\n\n---\n\n# Text-to-image (Qwen-Image-2.1) with a Chinese idea box\n\nType your idea in **Chinese** (or English) into the red \"idea\" node and press Run. It ships with the **same default idea** as the Chroma1-HD text-to-image template, so you can compare the two models directly. A local, uncensored Qwen3-VL-4B Heretic model first rewrites your idea into a well-structured English prompt, wired straight into `TextEncodeQwenImage21`; Qwen-Image-2.1 (Alibaba's 7B open-weights model, 2026-09, notably strong at Chinese context and in-image text) renders it at 1024×1024 in 25 steps at CFG 1 (the official settings).\n\nTo write the English prompt yourself, unplug the `prompt` input of `TextEncodeQwenImage21` and the field becomes editable.\n\n⚠ Needs ComfyUI **0.37+** on the worker (the `TextEncodeQwenImage21` node)."
      ],
      "title": "這是什麼範本 / What this template is"
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -20,
        780
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        460
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 18,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文**\n\n這一區是「模型載入器」，把三個檔案讀進來，再加上官方建議的前綴快取：\n\n- `UNETLoader` — 主模型（`qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot`，官方 int8 量化版，7.26 GB）\n- `CLIPLoader` — 文字編碼器（`qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot`，型別選 `qwen_image`）\n- `VAELoader` — VAE（`qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16`）\n- `QwenImage21Cache` — 官方的提示詞前綴快取，照預設 `auto` 即可\n\n缺任何一個檔案請看「⓪ 缺模型？」那張便條。\n\n---\n\n**English**\n\nThe model loaders: the int8 diffusion model, the `qwen3vl_8b` text encoder (type `qwen_image`), the VAE, plus the official `QwenImage21Cache` prefix cache (leave it on `auto`). See the \"⓪ Missing models?\" note if any file is missing."
      ],
      "title": "① 模型載入器 / Model loaders"
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        400,
        1180
      ],
      "size": [
        760,
        420
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 19,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文 — 你只需要改紅框那一顆**\n\n這是一支**通用文生圖**範本，題材不限。紅框的「想法」節點打**中文**就好（英文也行）：一句話寫清楚主體、動作、場景、氛圍。\n後面那串節點會把你的想法包進指令模板，交給本機的 Qwen3-VL-4B Heretic（無審查版）寫成英文提示詞，自動接進右邊的 `TextEncodeQwenImage21`——露骨的想法也照寫，不會被拒絕。\n預設這句武俠場景和 Chroma 版範本完全相同，跑完把兩張圖放在一起就能比較兩個模型。\n\n---\n\n**English — the red node is the only thing you edit**\n\nWrite your idea (Chinese is fine) in the red node; the chain wraps it in an instruction template and the local, uncensored Qwen3-VL-4B Heretic writes the English prompt, wired straight into `TextEncodeQwenImage21`. The default idea is identical to the Chroma template's, so run both and compare the models side by side."
      ],
      "title": "② 想法 → 提示詞 / Idea → prompt"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1800,
        620
      ],
      "size": [
        660,
        420
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 20,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文 — 取樣參數什麼時候要動**\n\n- `EmptyLatentImage` 的 `width`/`height` = 出圖尺寸。Qwen-Image-2.1 原生支援到 2048×2048，想出 2K 就改成 2048，但時間和 VRAM 需求都會變高。\n- `KSampler`：`steps 25`、`cfg 1`、`euler / simple` 是官方建議值。**CFG 1 時負向提示詞無效**，這是正常的。\n- `seed` 預設每次隨機；想重現同一張圖就把 `control_after_generate` 改成 `fixed`。\n\n---\n\n**English — when to touch the sampler**\n\n`EmptyLatentImage` sets the output size (native up to 2048×2048). `steps 25, cfg 1, euler/simple` are the official settings; at CFG 1 the negative prompt has no effect, which is expected. Seed is randomized per run — set it to `fixed` to reproduce an image."
      ],
      "title": "③ 取樣參數 / Sampler"
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        2520,
        840
      ],
      "size": [
        500,
        360
      ],
      "flags": {},
